Package: qrylz
Version: 1.0.3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Anon4You
Depends: openjdk-21, wget
Section: android
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Anon4You/Qrylz
Description: APK signature-verification patcher
 Patch an APK so its own signature check keeps working after it is
 re-signed with a different key. Merges split APKs, reads the original
 signing certificate and injects a tiny payload - output stays unsigned,
 sign it yourself afterwards.
